# entr 5.8 构建日志

**构建日期**: 2026-05-15
**构建系统**: 自定义 configure (非 autotools)
**目标平台**: OpenHarmony aarch64

---

## 构建环境

```
OS: HarmonyOS HongMeng Kernel 1.12.0
Arch: aarch64
Compiler: clang 15.0.4
Make: GNU Make 4.4.1
Source: https://eradman.com/entrproject/code/entr-5.8.tar.gz
```

---

## Step 1: 配置

**问题**: entr 的 configure 脚本通过 `uname` 判断操作系统，HarmonyOS 返回 "HarmonyOS" 而非 "Linux"

**解决**: 设置环境变量强制使用 Linux Makefile

```bash
$ TARGET_OS=Linux ./configure
+ cp Makefile.linux Makefile
```

**生成的 Makefile 内容**:
```makefile
CPPFLAGS += -D_GNU_SOURCE -D_LINUX_PORT -Imissing
MANPREFIX ?= ${PREFIX}/share/man
EXTRA_SRC = missing/kqueue_inotify.c

include Makefile.bsd
```

---

## Step 2: 编译

```bash
$ make PREFIX=/storage/Users/currentUser/usr/local
cat /dev/null missing/kqueue_inotify.c > compat.c
cc  -D_GNU_SOURCE -D_LINUX_PORT -Imissing -DRELEASE=\"5.7\" -c status.c
cc  -D_GNU_SOURCE -D_LINUX_PORT -Imissing -DRELEASE=\"5.7\" -c entr.c
cc  -D_GNU_SOURCE -D_LINUX_PORT -Imissing -DRELEASE=\"5.7\" -c compat.c
cc  -D_GNU_SOURCE -D_LINUX_PORT -Imissing -o entr compat.o status.o entr.o
```

**结果**: ✅ 编译成功，无错误无警告

---

## Step 3: 安装 (DESTDIR 模式)

```bash
$ make install PREFIX=/storage/Users/currentUser/usr/local DESTDIR=/storage/Users/currentUser/test-install-entr-5.8
install entr /storage/Users/currentUser/test-install-entr-5.8/storage/Users/currentUser/usr/local/bin
install -m 644 entr.1 /storage/Users/currentUser/test-install-entr-5.8/storage/Users/currentUser/usr/local/share/man/man1
```

**安装产物**:
- `/storage/Users/currentUser/usr/local/bin/entr` (可执行文件)
- `/storage/Users/currentUser/usr/local/share/man/man1/entr.1` (手册页)

